            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Baking Nana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was well received with the Sunday football crowd. I didn't use the bean sprouts as they are nearly impossible to find around here these days. (Something about re-calls etc...) Oh well, it was great without them. I guess I could have added some shredded romaine. Thanks for a very pretty dip."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GemStarr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a small get together. I added Pasilla peppers and chopped olives. It was excellent and it went fast!",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-26T15:18:09.130Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jarcino"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a recent gathering, and it was a hit! The dip was completely finished by the end of the evening. The only alteration I made was using the entire package of the seasoning, because I didn’t realize until it was too late that I should have only used half.",
            "datePublished": "2020-02-09T14:12:26.923Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for an appetizer potluck. It was delicious. The only changes I made were to add some spices to the refried bean/avocado mix (cumin, chili powder) and instead of bean sprouts on top I used sliced black olives. I didn’t have any bean sprouts. The avocado in the beans was delicious.",
            "datePublished": "2019-05-13T22:35:47.273Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelly Dawn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So easy to make and so good! Can't get bean sprouts, so added lettuce instead. The first two layers just make it!! I will definitely make this again and again!",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-02T17:11:42.997Z"
          },
          {
